<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Galore Group year net profit slips.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Galore Group year net profit slips.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     2.93 vs 4.49</p>
<p>    Net					1.87 vs 3.69</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     0.50 vs 0.75</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	     2.00 vs 2.50</p>
<p>    Sales				  139.89 vs 136.34</p>
<p>    Other income			   5.10 vs 3.69</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    2.30 vs 4.50</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		  loss 1.01 vs loss 0.18</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked  </p>
<p>Pay date December 3</p>
<p>Reg date November 20</p>
<p>    Tax					0.05 vs 0.62</p>
<p>    Interest				 1.74 vs 1.78</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   3.36 vs 3.04</p>
<p>    Minorities				nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Galore Group Ltd is a manufacturer of barbeque equipment.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
